  <h2>Communicate: brief a fictional workshop team</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <p class="note-line">You never need to disclose your real work, school, home, location, schedule, goals, hobbies, abilities, performance, health, finances, family, relationships, travel, mistakes, habits, or plans. Use the Linden workshop, invent a neutral event, or share personal information only when you freely choose.</p>
